  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved healthcare infrastructure, healthcare personnel with enhanced capacity, strengthening maternal and child health services, empowering pregnant women, improved awareness of residents through Behavior Communication Change (BCC) activities.</narrative>
